# The Dockerfile git-clones MHC-TP into this path, so a pre-existing copy in the build
# context makes the clone fail ("destination path already exists"). On the server the
# MHC-TP reference data (HLA_PEPCLUST_REF_DATA) sits here, 2.6 GB that is bind-mounted
# at runtime and so never needs to be baked into the image.
app/tools/HLA-PepClust
